  "title": "Boris' Mexican Rice",
  "description": "Ground beef, rice, onion, green pepper and fresh corn are simmered in a spicy tomato and beef broth mixture in this easy one-pot meal. Serve with flour tortillas, sour cream, and salsa.",
  "authors": [
    "boris"
  ],
